    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyalūba kū kanisa ya Efeso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū malaika wa kanisa ya Efeso ng'wandīkīlage gīkī, ‘Ī mihayo īyī alīyīhaya ūyo ajidimile ī Sonda mpungatī mu nkono gwakwe gwa būlyo, na alī hamò na a makīndīkīlo mpungatī ga tala ga zahabu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīmanile ī milīmo yako na a makoye ayo gakakūkoyaga, pyī nū wiyūmīlīja wako, nī gīkī ūtadūgije ū kwiyūmīlīja kwikala na banhū babūbi. Namanile nī gīkī wabagīsīlīgije chiza abo bakwihayaga balī batūng'wa, ūbabona batī batūng'wa, bakūlomalomaga dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo namanile nī gīkī ūlī ng'wiyūmīlīja kūlwa nguno ya lina lyane, hama ūhandatīlile, na ūtaalī kūgwa ng'holò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nalī na mhayo gwa kūkūhūgūla; gīkī, wabūlekile ū būtogwa wako ū bo kwandya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, izūkīlaga aho wagwīlile ūgalūke, wandye hangī kwīta ī milīmo īyo wītaga ī kwandya. Ūlū ītī chene nakwiza ū kūlī bebe, nalyīnje ī likīndīkīlo lyako lya tala a ha lwandī lwalyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū mhayo gwawiza ūyo ūlī nago gūlī gīkī, wīkolilwe nang'ho ī milīmo ya Banikolayo, īyo nīkolilwe nū nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo alī na matū ni ayigwage īyo Moyo alījiwīla ī kanisa. Ū wa kūpyena nakūnzunīlīja kūlya a ha ntī gwa būpanga ūyo gūlī mu ngūnda go ng'wa Mulungu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyalūba kū kanisa ya Similina",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nū malaika wa kanisa ya Similina ng'wandīkīlage gīkī, ‘Ī mihayo īyī alīyīhaya ūyo alī wa Kwandya na wa Kūmalīja, ūyo akacha, alīyo ūbiza mpanga hangī: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabūmanile ū būluhi wako nū būhabī wako, gwike ūlī nsabi. Nabūmanile nū būsondagūji wabo abo bakihayaga gīkī Bayudaya, alīyo batī bene; a boi balī isinagogi lya ng'wa Shetani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūtizūbogoha ū būluhi ūbo būlīhaya kūkūsanga, managa gīkī ū Shetani alī hihī kūmugema; bamò bing'we akūmuponya mu jeela, na ng'hana mukūluhiwa ikanza lya shikū ikūmi. Alīyo handatīlaga, ūbize ng'wishigwa nūūlū kūshisha mu kūcha; nakūkwinha ngikili ya būpanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo alī na gūtū ni ayigwage īyo Moyo alījiwīla ī kanisa. Ū wa kūpyena atūkuumiwa nī licha ī lya kabīlī.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyalūba kū kanisa ya Peligamo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nū malaika wa kanisa ya Peligamo ng'wandīkīlage gīkī, ‘Ī mihayo īyī alīyīhaya ūyo alī na līlūshū lyūgī lya būūgī būbīlī: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namanile gīkī aho ūkikalaga h'aho līlī ī lisumbī lya būtemi lya ng'wa Shetani; alīyo ū bebe ūlīdimile ī lina lyane, ūtaalī ū kūkūleka ū kūzunya kwako ūmo ūnizunīgije ū nene, ūtalekanile nago nū mu shikū ja kūbūlagwa kwa ng'wa Antipa, ū nkaanīji wane ng'wishigwa, ūyo akabūlagīlwa mu nzengo gwing'we, ūmo akikalaga Shetani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nalī na mihayo ya kūkūhūgūla; nguno ūlī na banhū balebe ū ng'wenūmo, abo badimile malange ga ng'wa Balaamu, ūyo akananga Balaki mhayo gwa kūbatūūlīla Baisilaeli sha kūbipamya. Ūbalanga na kūlya shitambo sha kūfunyiwa kū shiikolile, hamò na kwīta būjingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ūlī nabo na bangī abo badimile malange ga Banikolayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū galūkaga; ūlū ītī chene, nakwiza wangū ū kūlī bebe, nize nilwishe būlūgū nabo na līlūshū lya mu nomo gwane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo alī na gūtū ni ayigwage īyo Moyo alījiwīla ī kanisa. Ū wa kūpyena nakūng'winha mana īyo ībisilwe, nakūng'winha n'iwe lyape lyandīkilwe lina ipya, īlo atīho wa kūlīmana, ūlū atī ū ng'wanukūji walyo dūhū.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyalūba kū kanisa ya Siatila",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nū malaika wa kanisa ya Siatila ng'wandīkīlage gīkī, ‘Ū mihayo īyī alīyīhaya ū Ng'wana wa ng'wa Mulungu, ūyo alī na miso gītī ndali ja moto, na mhambala ja kūbiza gītī chūma shipembilwe mu moto hūna shūguuswa sheela pe: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīmanile ī milīmo yako, nū būtogwa wako, nū kūzunya kwako, na a katūmamīle kako, pyī nū wiyūmīlīja wako. Namanile nī gīkī ī milīmo yako ī ya haha īkīlile a ha ya kwandya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nalīkūhūgūla, nguno ūzunije mihayo ya ng'wa Yezebeli, ū nkīma ūyo akihayaga gīkī ng'hangi; ūyo akabalangaga na kūbahembeka batūmami bane, wabalemba lemba, wabingīja mu būjingi na mu kūlya shilīwa īsho shikafunyiagwa shitambo kū mashiikolile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naang'winhile ng'wanya gwa kūgalūka, alīyo atatogilwe ū kūgalūka abūleke ū būmalahya bokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū managa gīkī nakūmponya mu būlīīlī; na a babo bakashihyaga nang'hwe nakūbaponya mu makoye ūlū batagalūkile bakalekana nasho ī shītīle shakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama a baana bakwe nakūbamala kūbabūlaga! Ū mu gīko pyī ī kanisa jikūmana gīkī ū nene hū nalī ng'wene ūyo nakagīsīlījaga ng'holò ja banhū na maganiko gabo. Hama hangī nakūng'winha būlī ūmò wing'we gīt'ūmo īng'wigeleelilwe kwanukūla kūlwa nhūmamīle yakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Alīyo pye a bangī abo mulī mu Siatila, abo mutagadimile a malange genaya, abo mutī nayo ī mihayo ya ng'wa Shetani īyo bakīkumīlījaga gīkī mishimu; a bing'we natūmutūūlīlaga nigo gūngī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike dūhū shūmīīlagi īsho mulī nasho kūshisha nize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wa kūpyena, wīlang'hana chiza ī milīmo yane kūshisha kū būkalīkījo, nakūng'winha būdūla higūlya ya mahanga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akūbadīīma na nang'ha gwa chūma, akūbabelagūla ūmo shiseme sha malongo shikabelagūkīlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ūmo nū nene waninhīla būdūla ū Baba. Nakūng'winha na sonda ya dilū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo alī na gūtū ni ayigwage īyo Moyo alījiwīla ī kanisa.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
